       "\n",
       "|          | Details |\n",
       "|----------|--------|\n",
       "| **5.1 - Outlook**\\\n",
       "Current RL research investigates many different directions: inverse RL, intrinsic motivation, hierarchical RL, meta RL, offline RL, multi-agent RL (MARL), etc.  | [Slide](slides/4.1-Outlook.html){target=\"_blank\"}, [Book](posts/4.1-Outlook.html){target=\"_blank\"} |\n",
       ": {tbl-colwidths=\"[80, 11]\"}\n"
